# ============================================================
# Foreign lockfiles
# ============================================================
# This workspace is pnpm-only, via Corepack and the packageManager pin in
# package.json. A stray npm/yarn lockfile is never installed from (CI runs
# `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`), but Dependabot still scans it and opens
# alerts against a dependency graph that does not exist here — which is exactly
# what happened with the root package-lock.json removed on 2026-07-31.
package-lock.json
**/package-lock.json
yarn.lock
**/yarn.lock
